{"ts": 1793742005.4572642, "proc": "Josephs-MacBook-Pro-85863-1793742005", "tag": "A", "kind": "out", "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"tools": [{"name": "council_status", "description": "Where the council stands for your seat: the agenda item, any pending motion, what happened since you last looked, and \u2014 if a round is open for you \u2014 exactly what you may submit, with reasons. Never blocks.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"since": {"type": "integer", "description": "show events after this seq (default: since your last look)"}}, "additionalProperties": false}}, {"name": "council_wait", "description": "Block until a round is open that you have not yet answered, or the meeting adjourns, then return the same view as council_status. Returns early (saying so) after max_wait_s; just call it again. This is how you wait your turn: nobody is penalized for answering slowly.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"max_wait_s": {"type": "number"}}, "additionalProperties": false}}, {"name": "council_submit", "description": "Submit your sealed intent for the open round. Nobody sees it until the round closes, when everyone's are revealed together. Your submission is final for the round: think before you submit. `action` must be one of those listed for you in the view.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"round": {"type": "string"}, "action": {"type": "string"}, "text": {"type": "string"}, "vote": {"type": "string", "enum": ["yes", "no", "abstain"]}}, "required": ["round", "action"], "additionalProperties": false}}, {"name": "council_record", "description": "The council's full record so far (minutes): every round, every revealed intent, every outcome. For catching up after arriving late or restarting.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {}, "additionalProperties": false}}]}}}
